{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content pipeline/reports/summary_20260926-141657.md -Raw; Get-Content AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_b4_selection.py -TotalCount 230'","aggregated_output":"# Research Pipeline Report - AdaRES_project\n\n2026-09-26 14:16:57 Asia/Shanghai (design)\n\n## 0. Goal Status\n- Phase 1 not reached: ScanRefer target mIoU >= 0.5150; champion B4-E30 0.5094; gap 0.0056. Phase 2 pending.\n- B1 baseline 0.5020; champion improvement +0.0074. Goal preflight succeeded once before this tick.\n\n## 1. GPU Overview\n| Server | GPU | Snapshot task | Preflight evidence |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| server-2 | 0 | G1 | Best 0.4983 at 28/30, 4/10 nonimproving; subsequent targeted GPU check: 22702 MiB used, 54% utilization |\n| server-2 | 1 | vacant | H5 terminated; targeted GPU check: 1 MiB used, 0% utilization. Read-only fixed-subset inference completed here. |\n\nServer-6 has `allowed_gpus=[]` and was not used. Monitor preflight succeeded once; it was not rerun.\n\n## 2. Running Experiments\n| ID | Config | Server | GPU | Epoch | Best mIoU | Acc@0.5 | spmIoU | No-Impr | Status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| AdaRES-G1 | `configs_song/model_paper5/adares_g1_metric_targets_res.yaml` | server-2 | 0 | 28/30 | 0.4983 | unavailable | unavailable | 4/10 | running |\n\n## 3. Queue Status\n| Position | ID | Config | Status | Depends On | Server |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | no waiting tasks | - | - |\n\nActive 1/2, running 1, claiming 0, waiting 0; admission budget one. No candidate passed diagnosis; the slot remains open.\n\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\n- Processed H5 terminal: best 0.5061 at 30/30 validations, protected early stop after 12 nonimproving validations, 0.0033 below champion. Terminal auxiliary metrics unavailable because monitor log pull failed.\n- Ran B4-E30 fixed first-16-scene native paired diagnostics (441 expressions) on server-2 GPU1. J1 pooled-language contrast higher for 123/240 missed oracles; J2 overlap crowding higher for 78/240. Rejected both without training, config changes or queue dispatch.\n- Added terminal and diagnostic analyses, motivation review, design-cycle stop condition and SHA256 evidence to `research_work.json`. Python diagnostic syntax check passed.\n- No admission receipt, candidate-only sync or safe monitor dispatch was invoked.\n- Removed one summary older than 24 hours by its report timestamp (`summary_20260925-135100.md`); its file modification time was newer.\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n- 2026-09-26 14:16:47 `route_change`: close H5 and reject J1/J2, leaving GPU1 vacant. See `pipeline/decisions/20260926-141647_route_change.md`.\n- Resume on G1 terminal outcome or an independent, prospectively diagnosed route with matched controls and native backward/resource tests. Do not treat this bounded cycle as global hypothesis exhaustion.\n\nNext scheduled tick: approximately 2026-09-26 14:47 Asia/Shanghai.\n\r\nimport argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef selection_predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(\r\n        self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp,\r\n    ):\r\n        rows = []\r\n        for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)\r\n            scores = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n            selected = int(scores.argmax())\r\n            point_masks = masks[:, superpoints]\r\n            truth = target.gt(0.5).to(point_masks.device)\r\n            intersection = (point_masks & truth).sum(-1).float()\r\n            union = (point_masks | truth).sum(-1).float()\r\n            ious = intersection / union.clamp_min(1)\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            pair_intersection = (masks[selected] & masks[oracle]).sum().float()\r\n            pair_union = (masks[selected] | masks[oracle]).sum().float()\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_oracle_overlap\": float(\r\n                    pair_intersection / pair_union.clamp_min(1)\r\n                ),\r\n                \"oracle_score_rank\": int(\r\n                    (scores.argsort(descending=True) == oracle)\r\n                    .nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0].item()\r\n                ) + 1,\r\n                \"selected_query\": selected,\r\n                \"oracle_query\": oracle,\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    logger = get_root_logger()\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, logger)\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    model.eval()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    state = checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint)\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(state, strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\",\r\n    }\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(selection_predictor(), model)\r\n\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        batch = dataset.collate_fn([dataset[index]])\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    if not rows:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No expressions in diagnostic subset\")\r\n    errors = [row for row in rows if row[\"oracle_iou\"] - row[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"checkpoint\": args.checkpoint,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"top1_miou\": statistics.fmean(row[\"selected_iou\"] for row in rows),\r\n        \"oracle_miou\": statistics.fmean(row[\"oracle_iou\"] for row in rows),\r\n        \"material_error_count\": len(errors),\r\n        \"error_pair_overlap_mean\": (\r\n            statistics.fmean(row[\"selected_oracle_overlap\"] for row in errors)\r\n            if errors else None\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_pair_overlap_ge_half\": sum(\r\n            row[\"selected_oracle_overlap\"] >= 0.5 for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_oracle_rank_le_three\": sum(\r\n            row[\"oracle_score_rank\"] <= 3 for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({key: value for key, value in result.items() if key != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
