{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-H1-H4_negative_diagnoses_20260925-173300.md -Raw; Get-Content pipeline/decisions/20260925-192049_manual.md -Raw; Get-Content pipeline/decisions/20260925-173423_route_change.md -Raw; Get-Content pipeline/experiments.csv -Tail 13'","aggregated_output":"# Independent route screens after G1\n\n2026-09-25 17:33 Asia/Shanghai. Read-only fixed first 16 ScanRefer\nvalidation scenes, B4-E30 best checkpoint. These are diagnostic subset\nresults, not population estimates or validation-selected hyperparameters.\n\n| Route | Fixed question | Observation | Disposition |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| H1 | Does 128-query sampling omit target-bearing seeds available among 256 FPS seeds? | 0/240 material errors had available-but-unsampled target seeds. 27/441 had no target-bearing FPS seed; their oracle mask IoU averaged 0.803. | Reject sampler-omission mechanism; no query-budget scan. |\n| H2 | Does a budget-preserving four-per-query first-layer fine shortlist improve target coverage? | Material-error coverage 0.70936 original versus 0.70842 balanced; 12 improved, 35 worsened. Later original layers already cover >0.89. | Reject this redistribution; no alternative k search. |\n| H3 | Does B4's separately trained mask-quality score head provide a useful standalone selection signal? | Score-only mIoU 0.38265 versus indicator 0.49186; among 240 material errors 40 improved and 44 worsened. | Reject standalone score-head reranking; no validation weight scan. |\n| H4 | Are relation-bearing expressions enriched among B4 selection errors? | 204/387 relation-marked material errors versus 36/54 unmarked (52.7% versus 66.7%). | Reject simple relation-gated successor; cohort is small and observational. |\n\nH5 is independent of H1-H4: it adds a final all-query message rather than\nchanging sampler top-k, fine shortlist, score weighting or relation gates.\nIts own diagnosis and gates are recorded in the H5 review and receipt.\n\nRaw paired evidence: `AdaRES-H1_sampling_16scenes_20260925.json`,\n`AdaRES-H2_fine_16scenes_20260925.json`,\n`AdaRES-H3_score_16scenes_20260925.json`,\n`AdaRES-H4_relation_16scenes_20260925.json`.\n\r\n# AdaRES_project 决策记录\n\n- **时间**: 2026-09-25 19:20:49\n- **类型**: manual\n- **问题**: Enable immediate research when an allowed GPU capacity slot becomes vacant?\n- **决策**: Set pipeline_policy.research_on_capacity_gap=true; keep six-gate admission and one task per GPU unchanged.\n- **依据**: The design trigger now bypasses quiet-tick and review cooldown for a capacity gap; current G1/H5 occupy both slots, so no extra admission is allowed.\n- **证据**: pipeline/goal.json; build_tick_context.py; test_tick_context.py\n\r\n# AdaRES_project 决策记录\n\n- **时间**: 2026-09-25 17:34:23\n- **类型**: route_change\n- **问题**: Which independent routes justify the second capacity slot after G1?\n- **决策**: Reject H1 sampler omission, H2 balanced first-layer shortlist, H3 standalone score head and H4 relation gate; admit distinct H5 late global query access.\n- **依据**: Fixed 16-scene paired screens disconfirm the proposed H1-H4 mechanisms; H5 has distinct access diagnosis and native backward/resource gates.\n- **证据**: pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-H1-H4_negative_diagnoses_20260925-173300.md; pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-H5_native_gate_review_20260925-172800.md\n\r\nAdaRES-B2,done_complete,server-2,\"0,1\",configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b2_metric_indicator_res.yaml,0.505,0.555,0.607,0.471,19,Improved B1 by 0.003 but remained 0.010 below target; completed all 20 validations\r\nAdaRES-B3,done_complete,server-2,\"0,1\",configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b3_mask_evidence_res.yaml,0.5014,0.554,0.609,0.464,20,Mask-evidence variant did not beat B1/B2; TensorBoardX EOFError occurred after final validation and checkpoint save\r\nAdaRES-B4,done_complete,server-2,0,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition_res.yaml,0.5070,0.556,0.607,0.472,19,Improved B2 by 0.0020 mIoU; completed all 20 validations\r\n2026-09-22 09:18:09,AdaRES-B5,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b5_token_grounding_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_complete,0.5030,20/20,\r\n2026-09-22 19:47:05,AdaRES-B4-E30,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition_res.yaml,server-2,0,done_complete,0.5094,30/30,\r\n2026-09-22 19:47:07,AdaRES-B2-E30,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b2_metric_indicator_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_complete,0.5058,30/30,\r\n2026-09-23 06:51:00,AdaRES-C2,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_c2_hard_negative_margin_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_complete,0.4980,10/10,\r\n2026-09-23 08:10:22,AdaRES-C1,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_c1_listwise_expected_mask_res.yaml,server-2,0,done_complete,0.4950,10/10,\r\n2026-09-24 01:47:05,AdaRES-C2-E30,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_c2_hard_negative_margin_e30_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_complete,0.5014,30/30,\r\n2026-09-24 05:47:02,AdaRES-C1-E30,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_c1_listwise_expected_mask_e30_res.yaml,server-2,0,done_complete,0.5008,30/30,\r\n2026-09-25 13:47:05,AdaRES-F4,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_f4_mask_reanchor_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_complete,0.5060,30/30,\r\n2026-09-25 14:47:04,AdaRES-D1,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_d1_full_query_comparison_res.yaml,server-2,0,done_complete,0.5080,30/30,\r\n2026-09-26 13:47:23,AdaRES-H5,configs_song/model_paper5/adares_h5_late_global_query_res.yaml,server-2,1,done_earlystop,0.5061,30/30,\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_j1_mask_language_evidence.py -TotalCount 280; Get-Content AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/dec.py -TotalCount 280'","aggregated_output":"import argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(\r\n        self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp,\r\n    ):\r\n        rows = []\r\n        valid = (~out[\"batch_mask\"]).float()\r\n        masks = out[\"masks\"].sigmoid() * valid[:, None, :]\r\n        scene = self.probe_scene\r\n        language = self.probe_language\r\n        token_mask = self.probe_token_mask.to(language.device).float()\r\n        text = (language * token_mask[:, :, None]).sum(1) / token_mask.sum(\r\n            1, keepdim=True\r\n        ).clamp_min(1)\r\n        fg = torch.bmm(masks, scene) / masks.sum(-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        bg_weights = (1 - out[\"masks\"].sigmoid()) * valid[:, None, :]\r\n        bg = torch.bmm(bg_weights, scene) / bg_weights.sum(\r\n            -1, keepdim=True\r\n        ).clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        contrast = F.cosine_similarity(fg - bg, text[:, None, :], dim=-1)\r\n        scene_mean = (scene * valid[:, :, None]).sum(1) / valid.sum(\r\n            1, keepdim=True\r\n        ).clamp_min(1)\r\n        scene_only = F.cosine_similarity(\r\n            fg - bg, scene_mean[:, None, :], dim=-1\r\n        )\r\n        intersection = torch.bmm(masks, masks.transpose(1, 2))\r\n        area = masks.sum(-1)\r\n        union = area[:, :, None] + area[:, None, :] - intersection\r\n        overlap = intersection / union.clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        overlap.diagonal(dim1=1, dim2=2).zero_()\r\n        crowding = overlap.sum(-1)\r\n        indicator = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"], dim=-1)[..., 1]\r\n        for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            point_masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n            truth = target.gt(0.5).to(point_masks.device)\r\n            ious = (point_masks & truth).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n                (point_masks | truth).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n            )\r\n            selected = int(indicator[index].argmax())\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"scene_index\": self.probe_scene_index,\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_contrast\": float(contrast[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_contrast\": float(contrast[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_scene_only\": float(scene_only[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_scene_only\": float(scene_only[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_crowding\": float(crowding[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_crowding\": float(crowding[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"contrast_iou\": float(ious[contrast[index].argmax()]),\r\n                \"scene_only_iou\": float(ious[scene_only[index].argmax()]),\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\",\r\n    }\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n\r\n    def capture_scene(module, inputs, output):\r\n        model.probe_scene = output\r\n\r\n    def capture_language(module, inputs, output):\r\n        model.probe_language = output\r\n\r\n    model.dec.ila_ffn_layers[-1].register_forward_hook(capture_scene)\r\n    model.dec.lia_ffn_layers[-1].register_forward_hook(capture_language)\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor(), model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        batch = dataset.collate_fn([dataset[index]])\r\n        model.probe_scene_index = index\r\n        model.probe_token_mask = batch[\"lang_masks\"]\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    errors = [r for r in rows if r[\"oracle_iou\"] - r[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"checkpoint\": args.checkpoint,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"oracle_contrast_higher\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_contrast\"] > r[\"selected_contrast\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_scene_only_higher\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_scene_only\"] > r[\"selected_scene_only\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_more_crowded\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_crowding\"] > r[\"selected_crowding\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_selected_crowding_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"selected_crowding\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_oracle_crowding_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"oracle_crowding\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"indicator_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"selected_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"contrast_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"contrast_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"scene_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"scene_only_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({k: v for k, v in result.items() if k != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\nfrom .sample_model import SamplingModule\r\nimport ipdn.torch.nn_new.functional as F\r\nfrom ipdn.torch.nn_new import MultiheadAttention\r\n\r\nclass ThreeLayerMLP(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\"A 3-layer MLP with normalization and dropout.\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, dim, out_dim):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, 1, bias=False),\r\n            nn.BatchNorm1d(dim),\r\n            nn.ReLU(),\r\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, dim, 1, bias=False),\r\n            nn.BatchNorm1d(dim),\r\n            nn.ReLU(),\r\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\r\n            nn.Conv1d(dim, out_dim, 1)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n        \"\"\"Forward pass, x can be (B, dim, N).\"\"\"\r\n        return self.net(x)\r\n\r\nclass CrossAttentionLayer(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model=256, nhead=8, dropout=0.0):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.attn = MultiheadAttention(d_model, nhead, dropout=dropout, batch_first=True)\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\r\n        self._reset_parameters()\r\n        self.nhead = nhead\r\n\r\n    def _reset_parameters(self):\r\n        for p in self.parameters():\r\n            if p.dim() > 1:\r\n                nn.init.xavier_uniform_(p)\r\n\r\n    def with_pos_embed(self, tensor, pos):\r\n        return tensor if pos is None else tensor + pos\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, source, query, batch_mask=None, attn_mask=None, pe=None, att_weights=None):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        source (B, N_p, d_model)\r\n        batch_offsets Tensor (b, n_p)\r\n        query Tensor (b, n_q, d_model)\r\n        attn_masks Tensor (b, n_q, n_p)\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        B = query.shape[0]\r\n        query = self.with_pos_embed(query, pe)\r\n        k = v = source\r\n        if attn_mask is not None:\r\n            attn_mask = attn_mask.unsqueeze(1).repeat(1, self.nhead, 1, 1).view(B*self.nhead, query.shape[1], k.shape[1])\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(query, k, v, key_padding_mask=batch_mask, attn_mask=attn_mask, att_weights =att_weights)  # (1, 100, d_model)\r\n        else:\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(query, k, v, key_padding_mask=batch_mask, att_weights =att_weights)\r\n        self.dropout(output)\r\n        output = output + query\r\n        self.norm(output)\r\n\r\n        return output, output_weight, src_weight # (b, n_q, d_model), (b, n_q, n_v)\r\n\r\nclass SelfAttentionLayer(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model=256, nhead=8, dropout=0.0, glu = False):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.attn = MultiheadAttention(\r\n            d_model,\r\n            nhead,\r\n            dropout=dropout,\r\n            batch_first=True,\r\n        )\r\n        self.nhead = nhead\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\r\n        self.glu = glu\r\n        if glu:\r\n            self.glu_p = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)\r\n            self.glu_g = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)\r\n\r\n    def with_pos_embed(self, tensor, pos):\r\n        return tensor if pos is None else tensor + pos\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x, x_mask=None, attn_mask=None, pe=None, norm=True, att_weights=None):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        x Tensor (b, n_w, c)\r\n        x_mask Tensor (b, n_w)\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        B = x.shape[0]\r\n        q = k = self.with_pos_embed(x, pe)\r\n        if attn_mask is not None:\r\n            attn_mask = attn_mask.unsqueeze(1).repeat(1, self.nhead, 1, 1).view(B*self.nhead, q.shape[1], k.shape[1])\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(q, k, x, key_padding_mask=x_mask, attn_mask=attn_mask, att_weights =att_weights)  # (1, 100, d_model)\r\n        else:\r\n            output, output_weight, src_weight = self.attn(q, k, x, key_padding_mask=x_mask, att_weights =att_weights)\r\n        if self.glu:\r\n            output = self.glu_p(output) * (self.glu_g(output).sigmoid())\r\n        output = self.dropout(output) + x\r\n        if norm: output = self.norm(output)\r\n        return output\r\n\r\nclass FFN(nn.Module):\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model, hidden_dim, dropout=0.0, activation_fn='relu'):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        if activation_fn == 'relu':\r\n            self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n                nn.Linear(d_model, hidden_dim),\r\n                nn.ReLU(),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n                nn.Linear(hidden_dim, d_model),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n            )\r\n        elif activation_fn == 'gelu':\r\n            self.net = nn.Sequential(\r\n                nn.Linear(d_model, hidden_dim),\r\n                nn.GELU(),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n                nn.Linear(hidden_dim, d_model),\r\n                nn.Dropout(dropout),\r\n            )\r\n        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x, norm=True):\r\n        output = self.net(x)\r\n        output = output + x\r\n        if norm: output = self.norm(output)\r\n        return output\r\n\r\nclass MLP(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\" Very simple multi-layer perceptron (also called FFN)\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, input_dim, hidden_dim, output_dim, num_layers):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.num_layers = num_layers\r\n        h = [hidden_dim] * (num_layers - 1)\r\n        self.layers = nn.ModuleList(nn.Linear(n, k) for n, k in zip([input_dim] + h, h + [output_dim]))\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, x):\r\n        for i, layer in enumerate(self.layers):\r\n            x = F.relu(layer(x)) if i < self.num_layers - 1 else layer(x)\r\n        return x\r\n\r\n\r\nclass QueryCompetitionIndicator(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\"Predict confidence from a query and its overlapping competitors.\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    def __init__(self, d_model):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.query_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        self.evidence_norm = nn.LayerNorm(3 * d_model + 1)\r\n        self.head = nn.Sequential(\r\n            nn.Linear(3 * d_model + 1, d_model),\r\n            nn.GELU(),\r\n            nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),\r\n            nn.GELU(),\r\n            nn.Linear(d_model, 2),\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, query, pred_masks, batch_mask):\r\n        valid = (~batch_mask).unsqueeze(1).to(pred_masks.dtype)\r\n        probabilities = pred_masks.sigmoid() * valid\r\n        areas = probabilities.sum(-1)\r\n        intersection = torch.einsum(\r\n            'bim,bjm->bij', probabilities, probabilities\r\n        )\r\n        union = areas.unsqueeze(-1) + areas.unsqueeze(1) - intersection\r\n        overlap = intersection / union.clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        diagonal = torch.eye(\r\n            overlap.shape[-1], dtype=torch.bool, device=overlap.device\r\n        ).unsqueeze(0)\r\n        overlap = overlap.masked_fill(diagonal, 0.0)\r\n\r\n        competition = overlap / overlap.sum(-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        normalized_query = self.query_norm(query)\r\n        context = torch.einsum('bij,bjd->bid', competition, normalized_query)\r\n        max_overlap = overlap.max(-1).values.unsqueeze(-1)\r\n        evidence = torch.cat(\r\n            [\r\n                normalized_query,\r\n                context,\r\n                normalized_query - context,\r\n                max_overlap,\r\n            ],\r\n            dim=-1,\r\n        )\r\n        return self.head(self.evidence_norm(evidence))\r\n    \r\n    \r\nclass DEC(nn.Module):\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    in_channels List[int] (4,) [64,96,128,160]\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    def __init__(\r\n        self,\r\n        num_layer=6,\r\n        num_class=256,\r\n        in_channel=32,\r\n        d_model=256,\r\n        nhead=8,\r\n        hidden_dim=1024,\r\n        dropout=0.0,\r\n        activation_fn='relu',\r\n        iter_pred=False,\r\n        attn_mask=False,\r\n        sampling_module=None,\r\n        kernel='top1',\r\n        global_feat='mean',\r\n        lang_att=False,\r\n        contrastive_align_loss=False,\r\n        num_proposal_fine=512,\r\n        num_proposal_query = [128,64,32,16,8,4],\r\n        num_proposal_query_inst = [128,64,32,16,8,4]\r\n    ):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.num_layer = num_layer\r\n        self.num_class = num_class\r\n        self.d_model = d_model\r\n        self.input_proj = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(in_channel, d_model), nn.LayerNorm(d_model), nn.ReLU())\r\n        \r\n        self.input_proj_2d = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(1024, d_model*2),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model*2, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model))#clip\r\n        self.sum_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        \r\n        self.lang_att = lang_att\r\n        self.contrastive_align_loss = contrastive_align_loss\r\n\r\n        H = 768\r\n        self.lang_proj = nn.Linear(H, d_model)\r\n        self.lang_norm = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n        \r\n        if sampling_module is not None:\r\n            self.sampling_module = SamplingModule(**sampling_module)\r\n        else:\r\n            self.sampling_module = None\r\n        self.num_proposal_fine = num_proposal_fine\r\n        self.num_proposal_query = num_proposal_query\r\n        self.num_proposal_query_inst = num_proposal_query_inst\r\n        self.query_generator = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(d_model, d_model))\r\n        \r\n        # DDI and SWA\r\n        self.qia_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qia_layers_fine = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qla_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qqa_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qqa_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.qia_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.sem_cls_heads = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        # self.scg = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        self.lqg = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        if self.lang_att:\r\n            self.lla_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.lia_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.ila_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.lia_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n            self.ila_ffn_layers = nn.ModuleList([])\r\n        for i in range(num_layer):\r\n            self.qia_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qia_layers_fine.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qla_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qqa_layers.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.qqa_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))\r\n            self.qia_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))\r\n            \r\n            self.sem_cls_heads.append(ThreeLayerMLP(d_model, self.num_class))\r\n            # self.scg.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lqg.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n\r\n            self.lla_layers.append(SelfAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lia_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.ila_layers.append(CrossAttentionLayer(d_model, nhead, dropout))\r\n            self.lia_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))    \r\n            self.ila_ffn_layers.append(FFN(d_model, hidden_dim, dropout, activation_fn))    \r\n        self.norm_qqa = nn.LayerNorm(d_model)\r\n\r\n        self.sem_cls_head = ThreeLayerMLP(d_model, self.num_class)\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/ipdn.py -TotalCount 260; Get-Content AdaRES/configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition_res.yaml -TotalCount 180; Get-Content 'D:\\\\project\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md' -TotalCount 140\"","aggregated_output":"import functools\r\nimport pointgroup_ops\r\nimport spconv.pytorch as spconv\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn as nn\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\nfrom torch_scatter import scatter_max, scatter_mean\r\nimport functools\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import cuda_cast\r\nfrom .backbone import ResidualBlock, UBlock\r\nfrom .loss import Criterion, get_iou\r\n\r\nfrom .dec import DEC\r\nfrom transformers import RobertaModel\r\nfrom pointnet2.pointnet2_utils import FurthestPointSampling\r\n\r\nclass IPDN(nn.Module):\r\n    def __init__(\r\n        self,\r\n        input_channel: int = 6,\r\n        blocks: int = 5,\r\n        block_reps: int = 2,\r\n        media: int = 32,\r\n        normalize_before=True,\r\n        return_blocks=True,\r\n        pool='mean',\r\n        sampling_module=None,\r\n        dec=None,\r\n        criterion=None,\r\n        test_cfg=None,\r\n        norm_eval=False,\r\n        infer_mode='pos',\r\n        fps_num=512,\r\n        fix_module=[],\r\n        task_type='res',\r\n    ):\r\n        super().__init__()\r\n        self.task_type = task_type\r\n\r\n        # backbone and pooling\r\n        self.input_conv = spconv.SparseSequential(\r\n            spconv.SubMConv3d(\r\n                input_channel,\r\n                media,\r\n                kernel_size=3,\r\n                padding=1,\r\n                bias=False,\r\n                indice_key='subm1',\r\n            ))\r\n        block = ResidualBlock\r\n        norm_fn = functools.partial(nn.BatchNorm1d, eps=1e-4, momentum=0.1)\r\n        block_list = [media * (i + 1) for i in range(blocks)]\r\n        self.unet = UBlock(\r\n            block_list,\r\n            norm_fn,\r\n            block_reps,\r\n            block,\r\n            indice_key_id=1,\r\n            normalize_before=normalize_before,\r\n            return_blocks=return_blocks,\r\n        )\r\n        self.output_layer = spconv.SparseSequential(norm_fn(media), nn.ReLU(inplace=True))\r\n        self.pool = pool\r\n\r\n        self.decoder_param = dec\r\n        self.fps_num = fps_num\r\n        self.text_encoder = RobertaModel.from_pretrained('./backbones/roberta-base')\r\n\r\n        self.sampling_module = sampling_module\r\n        self.dec = DEC(**dec, sampling_module=sampling_module, in_channel=media)\r\n        # criterion\r\n        self.criterion = Criterion(**criterion)\r\n\r\n        self.test_cfg = test_cfg\r\n        self.norm_eval = norm_eval\r\n        self.infer_mode = infer_mode\r\n        self.init_weights()\r\n        for module in fix_module:\r\n            if '.' in module:\r\n                module, params = module.split('.')\r\n                module = getattr(self, module)\r\n                params = getattr(module, params)\r\n                for param in params.parameters():\r\n                    param.requires_grad = False\r\n            else:\r\n                module = getattr(self, module)\r\n                module.eval()\r\n                for param in module.parameters():\r\n                    param.requires_grad = False\r\n\r\n    def init_weights(self):\r\n        for m in self.modules():\r\n            if isinstance(m, nn.BatchNorm1d):\r\n                nn.init.constant_(m.weight, 1)\r\n                nn.init.constant_(m.bias, 0)\r\n\r\n    def train(self, mode=True):\r\n        super(IPDN, self).train(mode)\r\n        if mode and self.norm_eval:\r\n            for m in self.modules():\r\n                # trick: eval have effect on BatchNorm1d only\r\n                if isinstance(m, nn.BatchNorm1d):\r\n                    m.eval()\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, batch, mode='loss'):\r\n        if mode == 'loss':\r\n            return self.loss(**batch)\r\n        elif mode == 'predict':\r\n            return self.predict(**batch)\r\n\r\n    @cuda_cast\r\n    def loss(self, ann_ids, scan_ids, voxel_coords, p2v_map, v2p_map, spatial_shape, feats, superpoints, batch_offsets, object_idss, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, lang_tokenss, lang_masks, coords_float, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, scenes_len=None, meta_datas=None, view_dependents=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        batch_size = len(batch_offsets) - 1\r\n        voxel_feats = pointgroup_ops.voxelization(feats, v2p_map)\r\n        input = spconv.SparseConvTensor(voxel_feats, voxel_coords.int(), spatial_shape, batch_size)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats = self.extract_feat(input, superpoints, p2v_map)\r\n        sp_coords_float = scatter_mean(coords_float, superpoints, dim=0)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats, sp_coords_float, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, feats_2d = self.expand_and_fps(sp_feats, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, scenes_len, feats_2d, mode='tr')\r\n        lang_feats = self.text_encoder(lang_tokenss, attention_mask=lang_masks)[0]\r\n\r\n        out = self.dec(sp_feats, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats, lang_masks, sp_coords_float, feats_2d)\r\n        \r\n        loss, loss_dict = self.criterion(out, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, object_idss, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, lang_masks, fps_seed_sp, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets)\r\n\r\n        return loss, loss_dict\r\n    \r\n    @cuda_cast\r\n    def predict(self, ann_ids, scan_ids, voxel_coords, p2v_map, v2p_map, spatial_shape, feats, superpoints, batch_offsets, object_idss, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, lang_tokenss, lang_masks, coords_float, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, scenes_len=None, meta_datas=None, view_dependents=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        batch_size = len(batch_offsets) - 1\r\n        voxel_feats = pointgroup_ops.voxelization(feats, v2p_map)\r\n        input = spconv.SparseConvTensor(voxel_feats, voxel_coords.int(), spatial_shape, batch_size)\r\n        \r\n        sp_feats = self.extract_feat(input, superpoints, p2v_map)\r\n        sp_coords_float = scatter_mean(coords_float, superpoints, dim=0)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats, sp_coords_float, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, feats_2d = self.expand_and_fps(sp_feats, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, scenes_len, feats_2d, mode='pred')\r\n        lang_feats = self.text_encoder(lang_tokenss, attention_mask=lang_masks)[0]\r\n        \r\n        out = self.dec(sp_feats, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats, lang_masks, sp_coords_float, feats_2d) \r\n        ret = self.predict_by_feat(scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp)\r\n        if meta_datas[0] is not None: \r\n            ret['meta_datas'] = meta_datas\r\n            if view_dependents[0] is not None:\r\n                ret['view_dependents'] = view_dependents\r\n        return ret\r\n    \r\n    def predict_by_feat(self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp):\r\n        # B is 1 when predecit\r\n        spious, pious, sp_r_ious, p_r_ious, pred_pmasks, scan_idss = [], [], [], [], [], []\r\n        seed_inds, sample_inds, indis = [], [], []\r\n        nt_labels = []\r\n        b = len(object_idss)\r\n        for i in range(b):\r\n            gt_pmask = gt_pmasks[i]\r\n            gt_spmask = gt_spmasks[i]\r\n            pred_spmask = out['masks'][i].squeeze()\r\n\r\n            pred_indis = out['indis'][i] # [n_q, 2]\r\n            # take the 1 \r\n            if self.task_type == 'gres':\r\n                indicate = pred_indis.argmax(-1) == 1\r\n                top = indicate.nonzero(as_tuple=False).squeeze(-1)\r\n                # nt_label\r\n                is_nt = False\r\n                if len(top)==0:\r\n                    is_nt = True\r\n                    piou = torch.tensor(0.0, device=pred_spmask.device)\r\n                    spiou = torch.tensor(0.0, device=pred_spmask.device)\r\n                    pred_spmask = torch.zeros_like(pred_spmask[0], device=pred_spmask.device)\r\n                    pred_pmask = pred_spmask[superpoints]\r\n\r\n                else:\r\n                    top_mask = pred_spmask[top] # [k, n_sp]\r\n                    pred_spmask = top_mask.max(0)[0] # [n_sp,]\r\n                    spiou = get_iou(pred_spmask, gt_spmask)\r\n                    pred_pmask = pred_spmask[superpoints]\r\n                    piou = get_iou(pred_pmask, gt_pmask)\r\n                    if not is_nt:\r\n                        pred_pmask_binay = pred_pmask.sigmoid() > 0.5\r\n                        is_nt = True if pred_pmask_binay.sum() < 50 else False\r\n                nt_labels.append(is_nt)\r\n            elif self.task_type == 'res':\r\n                softmax_indis = F.softmax(pred_indis, dim=-1)\r\n                indicate = softmax_indis[:,1]\r\n                #print(indicate.max(), (indicate>0.75).sum())\r\n                top = indicate.argmax()\r\n\r\n                pred_spmask = pred_spmask[top]\r\n                spiou = get_iou(pred_spmask, gt_spmask)\r\n                pred_pmask = pred_spmask[superpoints]\r\n                piou = get_iou(pred_pmask, gt_pmask)\r\n            else:\r\n                raise NotImplementedError\r\n\r\n            spious.append(spiou.cpu())\r\n            pious.append(piou.cpu())\r\n            pred_pmasks.append(pred_pmask.sigmoid().cpu())\r\n            scan_idss.append(scan_ids[0])\r\n            seed_inds.append(fps_seed_sp[i].cpu())\r\n            sample_inds.append(out['sample_inds'][i].cpu())\r\n            indis.append(indicate.cpu())\r\n        gt_pmasks = [gt_pmask.cpu() for gt_pmask in gt_pmasks]\r\n        return dict(scan_id=scan_idss, object_ids=object_idss, ann_id=ann_ids, piou=pious, spiou=spious, gt_pmask=gt_pmasks, pred_pmask=pred_pmasks,\r\n                    sp_r_iou=sp_r_ious, p_r_iou=p_r_ious, nt_label = nt_labels, seed_ind=seed_inds, sample_ind=sample_inds, indi=indis)\r\n\r\n    def extract_feat(self, x, superpoints, v2p_map):\r\n        # backbone\r\n        x = self.input_conv(x)\r\n        x, mutil_x = self.unet(x)\r\n        x = self.output_layer(x)\r\n        x = x.features[v2p_map.long()]  # (B*N, media)\r\n\r\n        # superpoint pooling\r\n        if self.pool == 'mean':\r\n            x = scatter_mean(x, superpoints, dim=0)  # (B*M, media)\r\n        elif self.pool == 'max':\r\n            x, _ = scatter_max(x, superpoints, dim=0)  # (B*M, media)\r\n        return x\r\n    \r\n    def expand_and_fps(self, sp_feats, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, scenes_len, feats_2d, mode=None):\r\n        sp_ins_labels_expand = []\r\n        #feats_2d_expand = feats_2d\r\n        \r\n        batch_offsets_expand = batch_offsets[0:1]\r\n        for i in range(len(scenes_len)):\r\n            s = batch_offsets[i]\r\n            e = batch_offsets[i+1]\r\n            if i==0:\r\n                sp_feats_expand = sp_feats[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)\r\n                sp_coords_float_expand = sp_coords_float[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)\r\n                feats_2d_expand = feats_2d[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)\r\n                fps_seed_sp = FurthestPointSampling.apply(sp_coords_float[s:e].unsqueeze(0), self.fps_num)\r\n                fps_seed_sp_expand = fps_seed_sp.squeeze(0).repeat(scenes_len[i],1)\r\n            else:\r\n                sp_feats_expand = torch.cat((sp_feats_expand, sp_feats[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)),dim=0)\r\n                sp_coords_float_expand = torch.cat((sp_coords_float_expand, sp_coords_float[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)))\r\n                feats_2d_expand = torch.cat((feats_2d_expand, feats_2d[s:e].repeat(scenes_len[i],1)),dim=0)\r\n                fps_seed_sp = FurthestPointSampling.apply(sp_coords_float[s:e].unsqueeze(0), self.fps_num)\r\n                fps_seed_sp_expand = torch.cat((fps_seed_sp_expand, fps_seed_sp.squeeze(0).repeat(scenes_len[i],1)),dim=0)\r\n            for j in range(scenes_len[i]):\r\n                batch_offsets_expand = torch.cat((batch_offsets_expand, batch_offsets_expand[-1:]+batch_offsets[i+1:i+2]-batch_offsets[i:i+1]), dim=0)\r\n                if sp_ins_labels:\r\n                    sp_ins_labels_expand.append(sp_ins_labels[i])\r\n        return sp_feats_expand, sp_coords_float_expand, fps_seed_sp_expand, batch_offsets_expand, sp_ins_labels_expand, feats_2d_expand\r\n    \r\n    \r\nwork_dir: /bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints\r\ntrain:\r\n  seed: 1999\r\n  epochs: 30\r\n  interval: 1\r\n  pretrain: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/sp_unet_backbone.pth\r\n  save_epoch: 100\r\n  grad_clip: 0.1\r\n\r\ntest:\r\n  seed: 1999\r\n  test_topk_per_scene: 100\r\n  test_score_thresh: 0.0\r\n  test_npoint_thresh: 100\r\n\r\ndataloader:\r\n  train:\r\n    batch_size: 2\r\n    num_workers: 4\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n  val:\r\n    batch_size: 1\r\n    num_workers: 2\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n  test:\r\n    batch_size: 1\r\n    num_workers: 1\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n\r\ndata:\r\n  train:\r\n    type: scannetv2_sample_graph_edge\r\n    dataset: scanrefer\r\n    data_root: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/\r\n    prefix: train\r\n    suffix: .pth\r\n    training: True\r\n    mode: 4\r\n    aug: True\r\n    with_elastic: True\r\n    use_xyz: True\r\n    voxel_cfg:\r\n      scale: 50\r\n      spatial_shape: [128, 512]\r\n      max_npoint: 2500000\r\n    max_des_len: 78\r\n    lang_num_max: 4\r\n  val:\r\n    type: scannetv2_sample_graph_edge\r\n    dataset: scanrefer\r\n    data_root: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/\r\n    prefix: val\r\n    suffix: .pth\r\n    training: False\r\n    aug: False\r\n    with_elastic: False\r\n    use_xyz: True\r\n    voxel_cfg:\r\n      scale: 50\r\n      spatial_shape: [128, 512]\r\n      max_npoint: 2500000\r\n    max_des_len: 78\r\n    lang_num_max: 32\r\n\r\nmodel:\r\n  input_channel: 6\r\n  blocks: 5\r\n  block_reps: 2\r\n  media: 32\r\n  normalize_before: True\r\n  return_blocks: True\r\n  pool: mean\r\n  infer_mode: sem\r\n  fps_num: 256\r\n  task_type: res\r\n  sampling_module:\r\n    num_proposal: 128\r\n    pc_dim: 256\r\n    lang_dim: 256\r\n    d_model: 256\r\n  dec:\r\n    num_layer: 6\r\n    d_model: 256\r\n    nhead: 8\r\n    hidden_dim: 1024\r\n    dropout: 0.0\r\n    activation_fn: gelu\r\n    iter_pred: True\r\n    attn_mask: True\r\n    kernel: top1\r\n    global_feat: mean\r\n    lang_att: True\r\n    contrastive_align_loss: True\r\n    num_proposal_fine: 512\r\n    num_proposal_query: [128, 64, 32, 16, 8, 4]\r\n    num_proposal_query_inst: [128, 64, 32, 16, 8, 4]\r\n  criterion:\r\n    loss_weight: [1.0, 1.0, 0.5, 5.0, 0.1, 0.1, 0.1, 1.0]\r\n    cost_weight: [1.0, 1.0, 0.1]\r\n    loss_fun: focal\r\n    match_last_layer: True\r\n    layer_differ_weight: True\r\n  test_cfg:\r\n    topk_insts: 100\r\n    score_thr: 0.0\r\n    npoint_thr: 100\r\n  norm_eval: False\r\n  fix_module: ['text_encoder']\r\n\r\noptimizer:\r\n  type: AdamW\r\n  lr: 0.0001\r\n  weight_decay: 0.0005\r\n  paramwise_cfg:\r\n   text_encoder:\r\n     lr_mult: 0.001\r\n   input_conv:\r\n     lr_mult: 0.01\r\n   unet:\r\n     lr_mult: 0.01\r\n   output_layer:\r\n     lr_mult: 0.01\r\n   dec:\r\n     lr_mult: 1.0\r\n\r\nlr_scheduler:\r\n  type: PolyLR\r\n  max_iters: 70\r\n  power: 4.0\r\n  constant_ending: 0.0\r\n# 文档模板汇总 — songcl_research_pipeline\r\n\r\n本文件是流水线全部产出文档的**唯一格式源**。生成任何 pipeline 文档前先读对应模板，禁止凭记忆自由发挥。\r\n\r\n| # | 模板 | 写入路径 | 生成时机 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 1 | [Tick 报告](#1-tick-报告) | `pipeline/reports/summary_<ts>.md` | 每次 cron tick / 用户前台询问（`_manual` 后缀） |\r\n| 2 | [终态结果分析](#2-终态结果分析) | `pipeline/analyses/<id>_<state>_<ts>.md` | 实验判定为终态后自动生成 |\r\n| 3 | [实验设计](#3-实验设计) | `pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md` | 自主/手动设计新一批实验时 |\r\n| 4 | [动机审查](#4-动机审查) | `pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md` | 每次自主设计前（exp_design 的上游） |\r\n| 5 | [消融方案](#5-消融方案) | `pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md` | PHASE1_REACHED 后出方案与用户讨论 |\r\n| 6 | [决策记录/索引](#6-决策记录与索引) | `pipeline/decisions/<ts>_<type>.md` + `_index.md` | 每次决策（log_decision.sh 自动写） |\r\n| 7 | [Crash 修复记录](#7-crash-修复记录) | `pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<ts>.md` | crash 自修复时 |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. Tick 报告\r\n\r\n每次 cron tick 的 `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md` 和**用户前台询问状态**时，使用以下固定格式。**始终使用完整六段格式（0-5），不允许精简、不允许合并为单行**。即使没有任何变化，也要展开完整的表格结构和段落标题。删 24h 前旧 summary。禁止自由发挥。\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Research Pipeline Report — <project_name>\r\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS> (tick #<N>)\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 0. Goal Status\r\n  Target: mIoU ≥ X.XXXX | Champion: <id> X.XXXX | Gap: ±0.00XX | Phase: 1 (NOT YET) / 2 (ABLATION)\r\n  (从 pipeline/goal.json 读取，check_goal.py 结果。无 goal.json 时写 \"No goal defined.\")\r\n\r\n\r\n## 1. GPU Overview\r\n┌──────────┬──────┬───────┬─────────────┬──────────────────────────┐\r\n│ Server   │ GPU  │ Util  │ Memory      │ Process                  │\r\n├──────────┼──────┼───────┼─────────────┼──────────────────────────┤\r\n│ server-X │ 0    │ 95%   │ 18.6/24 GB  │ text_unet (pid 108985)   │\r\n│ server-X │ 1    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\r\n│ server-Y │ 0    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\r\n│ ...      │      │       │             │                          │\r\n└──────────┴──────┴───────┴─────────────┴──────────────────────────┘\r\nFree GPUs: server-X:1, server-Y:0\r\n(只列出本项目 SERVERS.yaml 中 role=gpu_server 且在 allowed_gpus 白名单内的服务器)\r\n\r\n## 2. Running Experiments\r\n| ID       | Config                        | Server   | GPU | Epoch    | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | No-Impr | Status     |\r\n|----------|-------------------------------|----------|-----|----------|-----------|--------|--------|----------|------------|\r\n| dec4     | model_early_exit_4_dec4       | server-2 | 1   | 29/50    | 0.4874    | 0.542  | 0.449  | 4/10     | running    |\r\n| text_unet| model_early_exit_4_text_unet  | server-3 | 0   | 21/50    | 0.4986    | 0.551  | 0.458  | 1/10     | running    |\r\n| ...      |                               |          |     |          |           |        |        |          |            |\r\n\r\n## 3. Queue Status\r\n| Position | ID   | Config                           | Status  | Depends On    | Server     |\r\n|----------|------|----------------------------------|---------|---------------|------------|\r\n| 1        | XXX  | ...                              | waiting | —             | server-X   |\r\n| 2        | YYY  | ...                              | waiting | XXX           | server-X   |\r\n| ...      |      |                                  |         |               |            |\r\nActive capacity: A active (R running, C claiming, W waiting) / N target → capacity OK / NEED MORE；candidate budget = B\r\n\r\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\r\n  - [自主早停] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [队列推送] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [代码同步] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [终态判定] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [实验设计] <action> — <result>\r\n  (无动作时写 \"No actions taken. All stable.\")\r\n\r\n## 5. Decisions Made\r\n  - [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <type>: <decision> (见 pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\r\n  (无决策时写 \"No decisions this tick.\")\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Next tick: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n**格式强制检查**:\r\n- 第 0 段: Goal Status — 每次必写。无 goal.json 写 \"No goal defined.\"，有则显示 target/champion/gap/phase\r\n- 第 1 段: GPU Overview — 只列白名单内的服务器和卡\r\n- 第 2 段: Running Experiments — 必须含 10 列(ID/Config/Server/GPU/Epoch/Best-mIoU/Acc50/spmIOU/No-Impr/Status)\r\n- 第 3 段: Queue Status — 队列顺序 + 深度判定\r\n- 第 4 段: This Tick's Actions — 每次必写，无动作也说\"No actions\"\r\n- 第 5 段: Decisions Made — 每次必写，无决策也说\"No decisions\"\r\n- **禁止精简格式**：不允许 `## GPU: server-4 GPU0(...), GPU1(...)` 这类单行合并。即使无变化，每个段落标题必须独立出现，GPU/Running 表格必须完整展开。\r\n- 结尾: Next tick 时间\r\n\r\n**用户前台询问**: 用户说\"查看 pipeline 状态\"/\"实验进度\"/\"pipeline 报告\"等:\r\n- 按六段固定格式现场输出\r\n- **必须同步写入** `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_manual.md`。使用 bash `cat > file << 'EOF' ... EOF` 写入，内容即上述六段格式的完整输出。不要跳过这一步。\r\n- `_manual` 后缀区分 cron 触发 vs 手动查询，方便事后追溯\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 2. 终态结果分析\r\n\r\n每个实验判定为终态后，**cron tick 必须自动生成该文件**。后续实验设计的 Phase 1 分析主要读取这组文件。\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Experiment Result Analysis — <project_name>\r\n  Experiment: <experiment_id> | State: <state>\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 1. Basic Info\r\n  - ID: <id>\r\n  - Config: <config_path>\r\n  - Server: <server> | GPU: <gpu_id>\r\n  - Started: <start_time> | Finished: <end_time> | Duration: <Xs/h>\r\n  - State: done_complete | done_earlystop | crashed\r\n\r\n## 2. Best Metrics\r\n  | Metric   | Value  | @ Epoch |\r\n  |----------|--------|---------|\r\n  | mIoU     | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n  | Acc@50   | X.XXX  | N       |\r\n  | spmIOU   | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n  (if crashed: last saved mIoU before crash)\r\n\r\n## 3. Convergence Summary\r\n  - Best first reached at: epoch <N>\r\n  - Subsequent no_improve epochs: <K> (if early-stopped)\r\n  - Final epoch best: mIoU=X.XXXX vs historical best=X.XXXX\r\n  - (简要描述收敛形态: 快速上升后平台/震荡/一直未收敛)\r\n\r\n## 4. Comparison\r\n  - vs baseline (<baseline_id>): γ = +0.00XX (有效) / -0.00XX (失败) / ≈0 (持平)\r\n  - vs current champion (<champion_id>): γ = ±0.00XX\r\n  - (列出所有可对比的前置实验)\r\n\r\n## 5. Conclusion\r\n  - 结论: [有效] / [失败] / [持平]\r\n  - 解释: <一句话说清这个实验证明了什么>\r\n  - 对后续实验设计的建议: <复现验证? 扩展该方向? 放弃?>\r\n\r\n## 6. Crash Info (if crashed)\r\n  - Error type: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\r\n  - Error message excerpt: <first 5 lines>\r\n  - Auto-fix attempt: <Y/N> — <retries> retries, result: <fixed/abandoned>\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
